OL,3,AReform confident it won't need to repay
OL,4,Aany of #72m under proposed new donor
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK believes the #72m in
OL,8,Fdonations it has received from two
OL,9,Fcryptocurrency billionaires were
OL,10,F"entirely in line with the law", the
OL,11,Fparty's economic spokesman has said.
OL,13,FRobert Jenrick told the BBC he did not
OL,14,Fexpect that the party will have to
OL,15,Freturn any of the money from Ben Delo
OL,16,Fand Christopher Harborne, who are both
OL,17,FBritish and have spent time living
OL,18,Foverseas.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
