OL,3,AAI staff 'genuinely frightened' for
OL,4,Ahumanity's future, ex-Anthropic
OL,5,Aresearcher tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FJacob Coxon was speaking to the BBC
OL,8,Fafter his resignation post on the
OL,9,Fdangers of AI went viral on a backdrop
OL,10,Fof growing safety concerns about the
OL,11,Findustry.
OL,13,FThe 27-year-old's former boss,
OL,14,FAnthropic head Dario Amodei, recently
OL,15,Fcalled for AI development to slow down
OL,16,F- though some have questioned the
OL,17,Fmotivations behind this.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
