OL,3,ATurkish police detain dozens in raids
OL,4,Aon gay bars and homes of LGBTQ+
OL,5,Aactivists
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in Turkey have detained 47
OL,8,Fpeople in a series of raids on gay bars
OL,9,Fand the homes of LGBTQ+ activists,
OL,10,Fofficials say.
OL,12,FRaids took place in 12 provinces over
OL,13,Fthe weekend as part of a campaign
OL,14,Fdubbed "My Family is Safe" that the
OL,15,FTurkish government says has been
OL,16,Fdesigned to protect family values.
OL,18,FOne of the targets of the operation was
OL,19,FLGBTQ+ association Kaos GL.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
